### BrewQueue API — open in VS Code (REST Client) or Rider/Visual Studio
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Menu
GET {{api}}/api/menu

### Place an order (run twice: second response is a replay with the same id)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f1c1d7e-7d2a-4a36-9c64-0b8a6f6d1a01
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-1

{
  "customerName": "Aroha",
  "lines": [
    { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuItemId": 7, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Same key, different body -> 422 idempotency_key_reused
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f1c1d7e-7d2a-4a36-9c64-0b8a6f6d1a01

{ "customerName": "Someone else", "lines": [ { "menuItemId": 2, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Missing key -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Aroha", "lines": [ { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Unavailable item -> 422 menu_item_unavailable
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 8b0a3d52-1111-4c4b-9a0e-2f5d7a9c0b02

{ "customerName": "Aroha", "lines": [ { "menuItemId": 9, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Board: active orders
GET {{api}}/api/orders?status=Received&status=Preparing&status=Ready

### Collect an order (replace the id)
PATCH {{api}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Collected" }

### Stats
GET {{api}}/api/stats/summary?hours=12

### Health
GET {{api}}/health/ready
